  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:amidah/qedushah/ledor_vador">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:amidah/qedushah/ledor_vador/1"/>From generation to generation
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:amidah/qedushah/ledor_vador/2"/>we will declare Your greatness,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:amidah/qedushah/ledor_vador/3"/>and to all eternity,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:amidah/qedushah/ledor_vador/4"/>we will sanctify Your holiness,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:amidah/qedushah/ledor_vador/5"/>and Your praise, our God,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:amidah/qedushah/ledor_vador/6"/>will not depart from our mouths
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:amidah/qedushah/ledor_vador/7"/>forever and ever;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:amidah/qedushah/ledor_vador/8"/>because You are the Almighty
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:amidah/qedushah/ledor_vador/9"/>Who is King; Great, and Holy.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
  </tei:text>
